            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>前襯鉛筆字下</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">12 S 90</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>前襯圓朱印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">慶應義塾大学医学情報センター／昭和47年7月6日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>前襯下朱印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">富士川文庫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>前襯下墨號</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">1924</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>前葉右題</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">鄙稿</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>前葉左題</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">斧政</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>題下署名</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">三宅均拜</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：昭和日期及墨號為館藏記錄。 左面：本幅為正文前單葉題記，與第5幅內題及正篇正文分開。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="5" facs="#f05" />
        <div n="5" type="scan" subtype="diagnostic-notes">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>藏印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">慶應義塾／大學醫學部／北里記念圖書（依篆形暫辨，「部」待覆核）</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">診病筆記</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">天保丁酉春予自京歸疫熱大行延門合戶互相傳染蓋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">客春以來霖雨蒸暄冷失序至秋米穀不稔其他卉木</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">亦皆不得繁茂是蓋天地之厲氣耳人之有生亦同在此</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">氣中而均長其物卉木既已如此則人豈得無疾病哉况</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">飢而不食或噬木皮或食糟糠是以胃氣餒而本氣不充</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">外邪之所以易入也故患之者卑賤之人十居其七吳又</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">可曰疫者感天地之厲氣本氣充滿邪不易入又曰飽食</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">者不病是也其証候頭痛灼熱大渴煩躁目昏耳聾甚則</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f05-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">譫語如見鬼狀是其爲陽証判然可知也但切其脉沈実</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f05-l-c07">
              <label>左頁第7欄上方眉注（有為旁書小字）</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">明吳有性／字又可著／温疫論</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f05-l-c03">
              <label>左3旁添</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">至（鄰「蒸暄」，黑色重描字字界待核）</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f05-l-c04">
              <label>左4旁添</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">也（鄰「耳」）</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：正文由左面起，右面有館藏方印。 左面：左3「蒸暄」間有重描及旁添，未臆補原字。左5「均長」、左6「噬」、左9「候」均暫讀，待覆核。 左面：底本 SHA-256 775a62d6fa39615b159806e2e0f975d0d148d26abb8d1c85f2c15f2d7c24f2ea。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="6" facs="#f06" />
        <div n="6" type="scan" subtype="diagnostic-notes">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而無力觀其舌紅朱而無胎者則陰氣內伏虛火炎上之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">所致誤爲陽証与大黄石膏類則其變如翻手矣予讀荻</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">野尚藥温疫餘論視其多用附子以免危急乃斷然投附</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">子能得起死者往々有之今記其一二於下</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">指物屋善代藏年三十許患疫十二日煩熱不解大渴引</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">飲日夜不得眠譫語如有所視真白虎之的証也而察其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">脉舌則是非陽証陰火炎上勘而可知也初服其医</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">藥諸証日盛乃延予々私按其劑果菊花茶調加石膏也</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">予指石膏示其婦曰本劑実當但此一味在予則雲泥不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f06-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">啻諸証之日盛実依此一味也乃与柴胡陷胸加附子細</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">石膏涼藥附子温物相爲仇敵</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">荻野台州乃尚藥医名京中</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">白虎湯主用石膏</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>右2、右3並行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">台州</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>右3、右4間小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">奏其功／〔日文小字數字待辨〕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>右7下注文</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">吉村文哲</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">辛葛根續□湯与之三服譫語即止後三日跪坐告状又</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">二日諸証頓退乃投竹茹温胆湯以解其餘熱後足趺微</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">腫乃与医王加水復平常</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">某氏女年廿三四患疫初発苦頭痛舌微白胎渴欲飲水</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">与食則呕与九味清脾湯其呕雖止悪食如故熱氣益熾</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">三日食益不進舌胎頓消其色如朱六七日心腹脹満身</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">体痺痛耳聾目赤大便不通患者促下予曰勿急不通乃</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">藥乃斷然与柴胡陷胸加附子葛根兼以泊夫藍龍腦至</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">十二三日諸証自若食殆絶此時予猶狐疑于附子於是</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f06-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">試与柴陷加大黄一服明日大便瀉利神氣稍衰乃知其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f06-l-c01">
              <label>左1旁添</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">後（「与」旁）</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>左3旁注</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">茯苓（近「水」字）</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
