        <pb n="7" facs="#f07" />
        <div n="7" type="scan" subtype="diagnostic-notes">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f07-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">誤下急復前劑更加續□經十六日諸証大退後數日起</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f07-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">起是予用附子先登之功也後遇此証輒用附子多救危</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f07-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">難</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f07-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">樽屋文助年五十八九患疫五六日延予々至起坐告状</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f07-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">如不病者頭痛時甚食味二便無変診之脉舌雖淡諸証</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f07-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">較輕唯以年齒之高爲恐耳即投柴胡陷胸加附子細辛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f07-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">續□湯第十日噦発數日不止雖熱勢不熾氣體始羸時</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f07-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">発譫語經曰病深者其聲噦予是以益恐之百方無効凡</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f07-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">八日而噦自止諸証亦漸退後逢此証不必拘于治噦但</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f07-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">治其熱以待自然當其盛則橘皮丁香真陶犬瓦雞耳吳</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">脉舌ノ様ハ〔未定〕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">內經素問後人以爲黄帝所著</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">橘皮丁香古來以爲治呃逆主藥</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f07-r-c07">
              <label>右7旁添</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">後（鄰「第」）；頗（鄰「始」）</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>右9旁注</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">拘ル（小字假名）</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f07-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">氏曰但治本証其呃自止</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f07-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">下村作大夫年四十餘初患頭痛自以爲上氣灸足三里</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f07-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">袒禓不避風日後四五日頭痛益甚発熱悪寒自知爲邪</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f07-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">氣所冐延予々初与柴葛解肌湯諸証漸長舌如傅朱渴</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f07-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">欲熱水譫語煩熱胸中痞悶時吐津唾小便短少予視其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f07-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">舌状幡然轉真武湯兼以泊夫藍龍腦更与烏梅丸吐唾</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f07-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">即止第九日延一医處以瀉心導赤散雖有所異与</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f07-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">予所見不同以恐當局之有惑姑按其所處後二日諸証</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f07-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">自若渴益甚乃又作柴胡陷胸加附子細辛續□湯与之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f07-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">十七八日諸証漸退但身重足弱乃与医王加麥門冬五</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">柴葛解肌湯方中有石膏真武湯方中主附子</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>左7窗注</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">以後〔字形與旁訂位置待辨〕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>左7医名小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">龍神良仙</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
