            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:7">
              <quote>續□</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">州</seg>
              <note type="editorial">第6、7幅四見同形，形近州，未定字照留。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:9">
              <quote>續□</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">州</seg>
              <note type="editorial">第6、7幅四見同形，形近州，未定字照留。</note>
            </ab>
