        <pb n="8" facs="#f08" />
        <div n="8" type="scan" subtype="diagnostic-notes">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f08-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">味子湯稍々復故</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f08-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">世医不知今歳之疫或屬陰証輒投黄連解毒湯若瀉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f08-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">心導赤散類療之凡是等之方雖係清熱比之石膏大</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f08-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">黄類絶無峻涼攻撃之効故雖用之無大害自非沈深</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f08-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之証亦能随而解但遷延引日変証漸至或小便癃閉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f08-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">或遍身浮腫其他諸証不可量識至此俄変志于附子</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f08-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">曰証之轉変雖固如此也是非証之罪不知其初既爲</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f08-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">陰証之罪也并録備後察</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f08-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">茶屋利兵衛妻年廿五六妊娠八月患疫医投柴胡</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f08-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">陷胸湯黄連解毒湯類副以泊夫藍龍腦五月二日辰牌</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>右9医名小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">山嵜松意</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f08-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">分娩活胎胞衣不下未牌延予々</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f08-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">曰夫胞衣不下治産科之所難大抵先投破血峻撃之劑</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f08-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不及而後施息胞之術尋常婦人猶恐卒変况此婦疫熱</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f08-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">熾盛神氣始衰雖此一証危殆難圖決不可投峻撃之劑</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f08-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">况手術乎但泊夫藍龍腦功兼兩証宜倍其量請且主用</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f08-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">黄連解毒湯四物湯合方加茅□大量以候自然耳前医</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f08-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">隨予言夜延後藤元迪其按曰二難実并宜先投柴胡陷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f08-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">胸湯兼以小劑桂枝延胡索桃仁牡丹皮類以試其機遂</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f08-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">隨其言明日巳牌胞衣自下神氣稍安後熱候歴險而状</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f08-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">復嗚乎微後藤氏之勇則不至如此孫真人曰志欲大信</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>上欄小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">桂枝延胡諸藥皆破血峻撃之劑</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>左1夾注</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">凡妊娠未彌月因病致産者十七八爲死胎</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">左面：右3「凡是」、右8「并」、右9醫名用字依圖暫錄。左3「息胞」、左6「茅」次字及左10「嗚」待覆核。左10以下跨幅續文。 左面：底本 SHA-256 2659701fa84fb963dce1048300d2acc9003a38e242b22ed27091e00ece6bd1cb。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:6">
              <quote>□</quote>
              <note type="editorial">部分筆畫不清，原圖字形待核。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="9" facs="#f09" />
        <div n="9" type="scan" subtype="diagnostic-notes">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f09-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">矣</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f09-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">近藤熊之助妻年三十許妊娠彌月臨盆破漿已來三日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f09-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不娩胎橫露手前医既与十全大補湯第二朝以予</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f09-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">近至京新得產術延予診之脈微弱腹狀虛軟乃探宮察</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f09-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之見露右手既已及膊乃按腹整胎整橫諸</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f09-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">術施之數三四次期以候晚施術晡時陣疼纔至力息始</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f09-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">來脈亦少數予診曰可矣今而不下胎死腹中母体隨危</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f09-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">申之以此病家不肯曰請候</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f09-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">自然至夜諸候自若体気漸憊按之胎死不動予荐促之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f09-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不許苦楚漸加腹内痺痛不眠徹晨明晨其族進藤士番</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f09-r-c03">
              <label>右頁第3欄「前」外小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">某</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f09-r-c03">
              <label>右頁第3欄「医」後雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">龍神／良仙</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f09-r-c05">
              <label>右頁第5欄「膊」後雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">露手及膊者／於術為難</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f09-r-c08">
              <label>右頁第8欄上段雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">諸產科施回生術必俟胎死／予所得則有下活胎之法</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation">
              <label>右頁末欄「番」左小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">大</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f09-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">夫來揖曰產婦痛苦我不忍坐視之請子為下之予曰苦</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f09-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">楚弥甚憊羸益極今而施術命危於累卵萬一有変而門</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f09-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">闔家果無遺憾乎則予為下之許之婦与其母聞之泣曰</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f09-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">若為下之先賜一貼麻藥否則恐倍苦痛予以其非證不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f09-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">聽其母曰不得則寧使我死而後用術諸医相謀作單味</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f09-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">廣參湯偽為麻藥与之并以消夫慮乃隨法以回生術下</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f09-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之胎鎮然不動且施且休第三次始下母体殊安痺痛隨</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f09-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">治一門闔家以予為司命是予治產施術初顯之功人亦</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f09-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">聞之称譽實四月廿六日也蓋按此婦曩患風湿未全復</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f09-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而妊產者前後六回逆產者一兒育者一人左股下有塊</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f09-l-c03">
              <label>左頁第3欄「許之」右小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">進藤士番</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：「及膊」兩見，右旁筆畫簡寫。「整胎整橫」前一「整」上部草寫。末欄「士番」與左下小字「大」的關係未定。 左面：第1欄「揖」右部行草可疑。第2欄「憊羸」連筆。第6欄候讀「消夫慮」；「慮」下部寫法特殊。第3欄「許」旁有直線。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:5">
              <quote>及膊</quote>
              <note type="editorial">「及膊」兩見，右旁筆畫簡寫。「整胎整橫」前一「整」上部草寫。末欄「士番」與左下小字「大」的關係未定。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:5">
