        <pb n="10" facs="#f10" />
        <div n="10" type="scan" subtype="diagnostic-notes">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f10-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">按之則痛患之十餘年諸療無効加之以質之薄弱若非</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f10-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">用藥之久碎其塊而化其質則将来又不可量也</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f10-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">丹羽正□妹年廿歲許肝木亢動〻則致□□心下石硬</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f10-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">大便堅実甚則手足軟痿或數日不省人事三兩年前患</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f10-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之兩度与破血攻撃抑肝鎮痙之劑而愈今夏卒発乾咳</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f10-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">數日不止診之心下石硬乃与小陷胸加杏子湯十餘貼</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f10-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無寸効乃知是前年之変候与大柴胡加杏子虎杖湯大</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f10-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">便快下而愈経曰病有標本不可不察也</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f10-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">渡部藤太室數日苦腹痛一医以為蚘虫療之痛日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f10-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">増劇延予曰廃藥待子久矣予診之心下石硬痛不可近</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f10-r-c09">
              <label>右頁第9欄「室」右小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">妻</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f10-r-c09">
              <label>右頁第9欄「医」後雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">後藤／元迪</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f10-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">乃告曰是非蚘虫毒結胸中也問其大便則曰不通數日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f10-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">乃作大陷胸湯与之三服而大便快下硬痛頓消論曰心</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f10-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">下滿而硬痛者此為結胸也大陷胸湯主之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f10-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">虎杖説</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f10-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">虎杖和名乙達得栗本艸綱目湿艸部載之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f10-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">陳藏器曰風在骨節間及血瘀者作酒服之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f10-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">甄權曰治大熱煩躁止渇利小便厭一切熱毒</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f10-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">又曰暑月以根和甘草同煎為飲色如琥珀可愛甚甘美</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f10-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">瓶置井中令冷澈如氷時人呼為冷飲子啜之且尊於茗</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f10-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">極解暑毒</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f10-l-c02">
              <label>左頁第2欄上方雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">漢張機／傷寒論</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f10-l-c06">
              <label>左頁第6欄上方雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">唐人著／本艸拾遺</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f10-l-c07">
              <label>左頁第7欄上方雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">唐人著／藥性本艸</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第3欄「丹羽正□」末字形近「司」或「月」。第3欄「□癪」前字形繁，候「癇」。第9欄醫者小字姓名後一字似「逸」或「迪」。第9欄「蚘」同左頁第1欄。 左面：第4欄為篇題。第5欄和名逐字候讀「乙達得栗」；原有空格區分和名與文獻。第7欄「壓」為描述文字中的原讀。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:3">
              <quote>□</quote>
              <note type="editorial">部分筆畫不清，原圖字形待核。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="11" facs="#f11" />
        <div n="11" type="scan" subtype="diagnostic-notes">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f11-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">肘後方曰時疫流毒攻手足腫痛欲斷用虎杖根剉煮汁</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f11-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">漬之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f11-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">董庵氏按今茲丁酉疫熱大行延門合戸連枕并蓐世俗</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f11-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">多煎虎杖根甘艸二味服之以為除疫良劑蓋近年治痙</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f11-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">病必以此為君按古説未有及之者但相傳以為破血劑</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f11-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">頗称其功旁及除熱解暑之説按此物気温能破宿血故</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f11-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">亦駆散表邪猶桂枝功今標本艸所引除熱一二説以證</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f11-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">俗傳有據蓋邪気在表服之可散其在裡則無効諸血虛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f11-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">家宜忌用之若夫以此専為除疫良劑不顧佗藥者則愚</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f11-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">眞鄙民之常豈足以議乎或波多野青雅以鬻藥為産以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f11-r-c01">
              <label>右頁第1欄上方雙行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">晉葛洪／著</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f11-r-c10">
              <label>右頁第10欄上方三行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">波多野青雅／称増田屋／太郎市者</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f11-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人之買虎杖者多問予其説因録此似之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f11-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">堀田金弥室齒齦腫痛漸成紫色臭膿淋漓身熱時熾乃</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f11-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">服以黄連解毒湯加大黄更以家方雞舌散含嗽口中又</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f11-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">傅其齦上以氷硼散二十餘日而全効</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f11-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">三好半五郎男年十歳許亦患前證但熱気不甚小便澀</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f11-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">滯乃反投以八味丸料含嗽傅敷則如前法未旬日全効</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f11-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">蓋前證之与此證芩連附子之所以異則在其熱候与小</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f11-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">便耳用劑相反則災害並至不可不慎也</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f11-l-c02">
              <label>左頁第2欄「室」右小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">妻</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f11-l-c03">
              <label>左頁第3欄上方三行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">黄連解毒／湯方中皆／清涼之藥</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="manuscript-annotation" corresp="#f11-l-c07">
              <label>左頁第7欄上方四行小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">八味丸方／中有附子／桂支之辛／温</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第3欄「延門」照字，或為「沿門」借寫。第9欄「佗」右旁簡寫。 左面：左頁第8欄「也」後有留白，結前病例。淡反透不另作正文。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
